Liens - Current Status
Separate from what has already been approved, and as of Friday September 12, 2025, our City has 175 liens attached to properties which is an increase of 19 liens since April 2, 20251 (156). The total value of current liens is $13,994,160, an increase of $1,363,975 since April 2, 20251 ($12,630,185).
In addition, staff continues processing liens for the Commission to consider taking foreclosure action against. As of Friday September 12, 2025, two have been approved by the Commission for foreclosure action, four are currently with our legal unit for their standard review, and one is scheduled for consideration by the Commission at the October 14, 2025 meeting.
Additionally, our lien reduction program as governed by Section 2-25 of our Code of Ordinances remains in effect.
